{"id":47338,"ord":50,"n_segments":152,"prev":47337,"next":47339,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Moving to California and the war years","title":"Young West Coast players; Nat Cole and Oscar Moore","category":"venue_city_scene","summary":"On arrival in L.A., Nat Cole's group was the goal; Oscar Moore was a fine guitarist but jealous of Bunn.","period":"early 1940s","year_from":1940,"year_to":1943,"words":165,"start":[83,3],"end":[84,12],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47338","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[{"name":"Nat King Cole Trio","focus":1,"leader":"Nat King Cole"}]},"people":[{"name":"Oscar Moore","qid":"Q2032843","n":5},{"name":"Irving Ashby","qid":"Q1577823","n":3},{"name":"Charlie Mingus","qid":"Q107432","n":2},{"name":"Buddy Collette","qid":"Q486899","n":2},{"name":"Nat Cole","qid":"Q137042","n":2},{"name":"Eric Dolphy","qid":"Q367508","n":1}],"story":{"theme":32,"theme_name":"Going west: California and the Los Angeles scene","community":57,"community_name":"Going west: moving to and working in California","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":83,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh. Did you hear any of those younger cats out here, then, that was playing out here?"},{"p":83,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah, I heard them."},{"p":83,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Buddy Collette and --"},{"p":83,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":83,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"-- Charlie Mingus."},{"p":83,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":83,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"All those guys."},{"p":83,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Charlie Mingus wasn't playing nothing."},{"p":83,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"He was pretty young then, still."},{"p":83,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. He wasn't playing nothing."},{"p":83,"b":13,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I'm trying to think who was playing then. Of course there was Buddy Collette, and well, Eric Dolphy came later. He was a real young cat."},{"p":83,"b":14,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"I don't know nothing about him."},{"p":83,"b":15,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Who was playing that early out here?"},{"p":83,"b":16,"s":"","x":"Well, your main --"},{"p":83,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Because Nat was the goal when I come out here."},{"p":83,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Who's that?"},{"p":84,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Nat Cole."},{"p":84,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, yeah. With that --"},{"p":84,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He had his group."},{"p":84,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, right. With Irving Ashby?"},{"p":84,"b":4,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Irving Ashby. Irving wasn't with him then."},{"p":84,"b":5,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oscar Moore?"},{"p":84,"b":6,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Oscar Moore."},{"p":84,"b":7,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oscar Moore."},{"p":84,"b":8,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":84,"b":9,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"He was a fine player."},{"p":84,"b":10,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Oscar was very jealous of me. I don't know why."},{"p":84,"b":11,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah, because he was such a fine player."},{"p":84,"b":12,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. Oscar was a good guitar player."}]}